[
  {
    "start": 44.72,
    "end": 67.8,
    "text": "Oh, I found you.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        44.72,
        67.8
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 68.12,
    "end": 83.64,
    "text": "How's everything?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        68.12,
        83.64
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 83.72,
    "end": 118.6,
    "text": "Well, your dad and I are finally putting together all our research at the hospital.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        83.72,
        118.6
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 118.68,
    "end": 154.52,
    "text": "I hear you typing. That's better.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        118.68,
        154.52
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 155.08,
    "end": 198.44,
    "text": "So we've been studying women under 40 who sleepless than six hours a night.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        155.08,
        198.44
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 199.32,
    "end": 215.0,
    "text": "And what'd you find out?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        199.32,
        215.0
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 215.08,
    "end": 273.28,
    "text": "It's interesting. It seems like they're 38% more likely to experience major weight gain compared to women who slept seven hours a night.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        215.08,
        273.28
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 273.36,
    "end": 290.72,
    "text": "Are you kidding me?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        273.36,
        290.72
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 290.8,
    "end": 315.6,
    "text": "You know I haven't slept in two years.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        290.8,
        315.6
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 315.68,
    "end": 336.6,
    "text": "Well, I can't change the facts, dean",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        315.68,
        336.6
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 336.68,
    "end": 338.2,
    "text": "Mom, you Know what?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        336.68,
        338.2
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 338.28,
    "end": 371.64,
    "text": "I'm rushing into the city for a meeting, and I need to prepare.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        338.28,
        371.64
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 372.28,
    "end": 393.24,
    "text": "Can I call you when I get home?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        372.28,
        393.24
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 393.32,
    "end": 411.64,
    "text": "Oh, you don't have to.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        393.32,
        411.64
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 411.72,
    "end": 427.2,
    "text": "Hey, how we doin '?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        411.72,
        427.2
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 427.28,
    "end": 451.44,
    "text": "Did you look over the material on Atwood?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        427.28,
        451.44
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 451.72,
    "end": 500.72,
    "text": "Yeah, I did. Uh, he had a great run at Travelocity and Citigroup, and I get it.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        451.72,
        500.72
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 500.8,
    "end": 505.0,
    "text": "He's major.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        500.8,
        505.0
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 506.32,
    "end": 553.36,
    "text": "And the best thing about him is he's been watching us, and he loves what we're doing.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        506.32,
        553.36
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 554.64,
    "end": 578.64,
    "text": "But he's only one of the names on the list.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        554.64,
        578.64
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 578.8,
    "end": 634.72,
    "text": "So if you don't like him, we move on.But, Jules, try to be open.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        578.8,
        634.72
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 635.4,
    "end": 668.32,
    "text": "He's supposed to be brilliant. And the VCs love him.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        635.4,
        668.32
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 668.4,
    "end": 699.88,
